      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Local sandboxes give developers a secure execution boundary for agentic workflows on their own machines.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:16.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Local sandboxing is powered by Microsoft eXecution Container (MXC) , which translates a common sandbox policy into native operating-system controls across Windows, macOS, and Linux.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:16.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With local sandboxing, developers and organizations can:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:16.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Control access to the internet, local networks, Git credentials, and GitHub CLI credentials.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:16.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Apply sandboxing to local tools and services, including local MCP and language servers where supported.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:16.818Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Local sandboxing is included with GitHub Copilot at no additional cost.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-07-local-sandboxing-for-github-copilot-now-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T15:46:17.000Z",
